          <FB Name="Control" Type="modlib::SKILL_Core" x="1200" y="0.33" Comment="The state machine of the skill Dispensing: checks a client's Start (occupation, module in Execute, not running, values in range), publishes State and ErrorID at /Objects/Filling/Skills/Dispensing, offers Stop, Abort and Reset there, starts Execute and runs Stop when the skill is stopped.">
